{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026yOKpuImAdj1793095065.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>姚焯菲上周公布舉行《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026澳門站》，並於12月26日晚上8時正。適逢演出當天為 Boxing Day，大家可以和 Chantel 一起過聖誕，因此消息一傳出，瞬即在她的粉絲群中成為熱門話題。</p><p></p><p>Chantel 表示為了和早前的演出有所不同，今次歌單也會重新設計，加添了一些之前香港站沒有唱過的曲目。Chantel 更趁著課餘時間專誠去購買聖誕禮物，留待個唱澳門站當晚送給幸運觀眾。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"1f21ec86-5241-4fe8-ab64-885a7335f958.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026HsbshUf5Vz1793095065.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"76c357c8-1006-47ab-9462-2c7cc43158a4.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20264WVCQbgOgP1793095066.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.412002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:20.987959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:27.320636+00:00","content_hash":"f657a2e42a935f6bbafc3c07222e438361dfa92a0c13ca88301156effb83e4b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}